     [38;5;246mA settings value the user can change (1h / 24h / 3 days). Adds a settings surface and a migration question when the
[39m     [38;5;246mvalue changes mid-flight for already-fired tasks.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Multiple: 3 days, 24h, 1h, overdue
     [38;5;246mFour notifications per task. Thorough, but a handful of tasks fills the feed fast and the bell stops meaning [39m
